<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Rugby union-South African Currie Cup standings.</title>
<headline>Rugby union-South African Currie Cup standings.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latest standings in the Currie Cup rugby union competition after matches played over the weekend (tabulated - played, won, drawn, lost, points for,points against, bonus points, total points):</p>
<p>  1. Natal			 7   7   0   0   319   121   4   32</p>
<p>  2. Western Province	  7   6   0   1   310   172   5   29</p>
<p>  3. Free State		  6   5   0   1   286   144   4   24</p>
<p>  4. Gauteng Lions	     6   5   0   1   230   198   4   24</p>
<p>  5. Griqualand West	   8   4   1   3   259   189   6   24</p>
<p>  6. South Western Districts 7   5   0   2   209   169   3   23</p>
<p>  7. Boland			7   2   1   4   227   207   7   17</p>
<p>  8. Northern Free State     7   3   0   4   208   308   3   15</p>
<p>  9. Northern Transvaal	6   2   0   4   167   192   4   12</p>
<p> 10. North West		  7   2   0   5   215   227   3   11</p>
<p> 11. Gauteng Falcons	   6   2   0   4   154   270   2   10</p>
<p> 12. Mpumalanga		  6   1   0   5   112   210   2    6</p>
<p> 13. Border			7   1   0   6   118   293   2    6</p>
<p> 14. Eastern Province	  7   1   0   6   124   238   0    4</p>
